{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-tsx","path":"/posts/highcharts/05_events/","result":{"data":{"allMarkdownRemark":{"edges":[{"node":{"html":"<h2 id=\"understanding-common-highcharts-events-highcharts-주요-이벤트-이해하기\" style=\"position:relative;\">Understanding Common Highcharts Events (Highcharts 주요 이벤트 이해하기)<a href=\"#understanding-common-highcharts-events-highcharts-%EC%A3%BC%EC%9A%94-%EC%9D%B4%EB%B2%A4%ED%8A%B8-%EC%9D%B4%ED%95%B4%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0\" aria-label=\"understanding common highcharts events highcharts 주요 이벤트 이해하기 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>Highcharts는 차트와 그 구성 요소에 인터랙티비티(interactivity)와 커스텀 동작을 추가할 수 있는 유연한 이벤트 시스템을 제공합니다. 이 가이드는 Highcharts에서 가장 일반적이고 유용한 이벤트를 소개하고, 이를 효과적으로 다루는 방법을 설명합니다.</p>\n<p>개별 이벤트를 살펴보기 전에, Highcharts에서 이벤트 핸들러를 연결하는 방법이 여러 가지 있다는 점을 이해하는 것이 중요합니다. 어떤 방법을 선택할지는 사용 사례에 따라 달라집니다.</p>\n<h3 id=\"highcharts에서-이벤트를-연결하는-방법-ways-to-attach-events-in-highcharts\" style=\"position:relative;\">Highcharts에서 이벤트를 연결하는 방법 (Ways to Attach Events in Highcharts)<a href=\"#highcharts%EC%97%90%EC%84%9C-%EC%9D%B4%EB%B2%A4%ED%8A%B8%EB%A5%BC-%EC%97%B0%EA%B2%B0%ED%95%98%EB%8A%94-%EB%B0%A9%EB%B2%95-ways-to-attach-events-in-highcharts\" aria-label=\"highcharts에서 이벤트를 연결하는 방법 ways to attach events in highcharts permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>이벤트는 설정이 정적인지, 동적인지, 또는 여러 차트에서 재사용할 의도인지에 따라 여러 방식으로 등록할 수 있습니다.</p>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>방법</th>\n<th>범위</th>\n<th>적합한 경우</th>\n<th>JSON 설정 지원 여부</th>\n<th>예시</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>설정(Configuration) 내에서</td>\n<td>차트 하나</td>\n<td>특정 차트에 대한 커스텀 동작</td>\n<td>❌ 불가 (함수는 JSON에 저장 불가)</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-text\">chart.events.load</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>컴포넌트 인스턴스에서 (Chart, Series, Point 등)</td>\n<td>이미 생성된 차트 하나</td>\n<td>설정이 백엔드/편집 가능한 UI에서 로드될 때</td>\n<td>✅ 가능</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-text\">Highcharts.addEvent(chart, 'render', ...)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Highcharts 클래스에서</td>\n<td>특정 타입의 모든 차트</td>\n<td>플러그인 스타일의 재사용 가능한 로직</td>\n<td>✅ 가능</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-text\">Highcharts.addEvent(Highcharts.Series, 'legendItemClick', ...)</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div>\n<h4 id=\"각-방법의-선택-기준-when-to-choose-each-method\" style=\"position:relative;\">각 방법의 선택 기준 (When to Choose Each Method)<a href=\"#%EA%B0%81-%EB%B0%A9%EB%B2%95%EC%9D%98-%EC%84%A0%ED%83%9D-%EA%B8%B0%EC%A4%80-when-to-choose-each-method\" aria-label=\"각 방법의 선택 기준 when to choose each method permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h4>\n<ul>\n<li>특정 차트에 대해 구현 시 인터랙션을 직접 정의할 때는 <strong>설정 내에서</strong> 사용합니다.</li>\n<li>차트 설정이 순수 JSON으로 제공될 때는 <strong>인스턴스 레벨</strong>을 사용합니다.</li>\n<li>여러 차트에서 일관된 동작을 원하거나 확장/플러그인을 작성할 때는 <strong>클래스 레벨</strong>을 사용합니다.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"코드-예시-code-examples\" style=\"position:relative;\">코드 예시 (Code Examples)<a href=\"#%EC%BD%94%EB%93%9C-%EC%98%88%EC%8B%9C-code-examples\" aria-label=\"코드 예시 code examples permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h4>\n<p>A) 설정(Configuration) 내에서 (가장 일반적)</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-js line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-js\">Highcharts<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">chart</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'container'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token literal-property property\">chart</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token literal-property property\">events</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n      <span class=\"token function\">load</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n        console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'Chart loaded'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n      <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<p>B) 차트 인스턴스에서</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-js line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> chart <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> Highcharts<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">chart</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'container'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token literal-property property\">series</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">data</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">2</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">3</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\nHighcharts<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">addEvent</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>chart<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">'render'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'Rendered (instance)'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<p>C) 클래스에서 (모든 차트/시리즈/포인트에 적용)</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-js line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-js\">Highcharts<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">addEvent</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>Highcharts<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>Series<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">'legendItemClick'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'Legend clicked:'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">this</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>name<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.highcharts.com/docs/extending-highcharts/extending-highcharts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Extending Highcharts 문서</a> 를 참고하세요.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"주요-이벤트-common-events\" style=\"position:relative;\">주요 이벤트 (Common Events)<a href=\"#%EC%A3%BC%EC%9A%94-%EC%9D%B4%EB%B2%A4%ED%8A%B8-common-events\" aria-label=\"주요 이벤트 common events permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<h4 id=\"1-차트-로드-이벤트-chart-load-event\" style=\"position:relative;\">1. 차트 로드 이벤트 (Chart Load Event)<a href=\"#1-%EC%B0%A8%ED%8A%B8-%EB%A1%9C%EB%93%9C-%EC%9D%B4%EB%B2%A4%ED%8A%B8-chart-load-event\" aria-label=\"1 차트 로드 이벤트 chart load event permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h4>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">load</code> 이벤트는 차트가 완전히 로드되었을 때 발생합니다. 초기 설정이나 수정 작업을 수행하기에 좋은 시점입니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-js line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-js\">Highcharts<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">chart</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'container'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token literal-property property\">chart</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token literal-property property\">events</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n      <span class=\"token function-variable function\">load</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">function</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n        <span class=\"token function\">alert</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'Chart has loaded'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n      <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token literal-property property\">series</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token literal-property property\">data</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">2</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">3</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">4</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://api.highcharts.com/highcharts/chart.events.load\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Demo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://api.highcharts.com/highcharts/chart.events.load\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">API option</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"2-차트-렌더-이벤트-chart-render-event\" style=\"position:relative;\">2. 차트 렌더 이벤트 (Chart Render Event)<a href=\"#2-%EC%B0%A8%ED%8A%B8-%EB%A0%8C%EB%8D%94-%EC%9D%B4%EB%B2%A4%ED%8A%B8-chart-render-event\" aria-label=\"2 차트 렌더 이벤트 chart render event permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h4>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">render</code> 이벤트는 차트가 다시 그려질 때마다 발생합니다. 요소를 업데이트하거나, 현재 차트 상태를 기반으로 계산을 실행하거나, 커스텀 반응형 요소를 그리는 데 유용합니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-js line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token keyword\">let</span> renderCount <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\nHighcharts<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">chart</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'container'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token literal-property property\">chart</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token literal-property property\">events</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n      <span class=\"token function-variable function\">render</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n        renderCount<span class=\"token operator\">++</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n        console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token template-string\"><span class=\"token template-punctuation string\">`</span><span class=\"token string\">Chart has rendered </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token interpolation-punctuation punctuation\">${</span>renderCount<span class=\"token interpolation-punctuation punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\"> times</span><span class=\"token template-punctuation string\">`</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n      <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token literal-property property\">series</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token literal-property property\">data</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">2</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">3</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">4</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://jsfiddle.net/gh/get/library/pure/highcharts/highcharts/tree/master/samples/highcharts/members/renderer-on-chart/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Demo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://api.highcharts.com/highcharts/chart.events.render\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">API option</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"3-차트-선택-이벤트-chart-selection-event\" style=\"position:relative;\">3. 차트 선택 이벤트 (Chart Selection Event)<a href=\"#3-%EC%B0%A8%ED%8A%B8-%EC%84%A0%ED%83%9D-%EC%9D%B4%EB%B2%A4%ED%8A%B8-chart-selection-event\" aria-label=\"3 차트 선택 이벤트 chart selection event permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h4>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">selection</code> 이벤트는 사용자가 차트에서 영역을 선택할 때(일반적으로 줌(zoom) 용도) 발생합니다. 선택한 영역의 정확한 좌표를 가져오는 데 유용합니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-js line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-js\">Highcharts<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">chart</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"container\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token literal-property property\">chart</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token literal-property property\">zooming</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> \r\n        <span class=\"token literal-property property\">type</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"x\"</span> \r\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token literal-property property\">events</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n      <span class=\"token function\">selection</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">e</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> text <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> e<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>xAxis\r\n          <span class=\"token operator\">?</span> <span class=\"token template-string\"><span class=\"token template-punctuation string\">`</span><span class=\"token string\">From </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token interpolation-punctuation punctuation\">${</span>e<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>xAxis<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>min<span class=\"token interpolation-punctuation punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\"> to </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token interpolation-punctuation punctuation\">${</span>e<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>xAxis<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>max<span class=\"token interpolation-punctuation punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token template-punctuation string\">`</span></span>\r\n          <span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">this</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">setSubtitle</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> text <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n      <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token literal-property property\">series</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n      <span class=\"token literal-property property\">data</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">2</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">3</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">4</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://jsfiddle.net/gh/get/library/pure/highcharts/highcharts/tree/master/samples/highcharts/chart/events-selection/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Demo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://api.highcharts.com/highcharts/chart.events.selection\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">API option</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"4-포인트-클릭-이벤트-point-click-event\" style=\"position:relative;\">4. 포인트 클릭 이벤트 (Point Click Event)<a href=\"#4-%ED%8F%AC%EC%9D%B8%ED%8A%B8-%ED%81%B4%EB%A6%AD-%EC%9D%B4%EB%B2%A4%ED%8A%B8-point-click-event\" aria-label=\"4 포인트 클릭 이벤트 point click event permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h4>\n<p>포인트의 <code class=\"language-text\">click</code> 이벤트는 사용자가 특정 데이터 포인트를 클릭할 때 발생합니다. 클릭한 포인트를 기반으로 추가 정보를 표시하거나 동작을 수행하는 데 사용할 수 있습니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-js line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-js\">Highcharts<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">chart</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"container\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token literal-property property\">plotOptions</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token literal-property property\">series</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n      <span class=\"token literal-property property\">point</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n        <span class=\"token literal-property property\">events</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n          <span class=\"token function-variable function\">click</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n            <span class=\"token function\">alert</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"You clicked on point: \"</span> <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">this</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>index<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n          <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n      <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token literal-property property\">series</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n      <span class=\"token literal-property property\">data</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">2</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">3</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">4</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://jsfiddle.net/gh/get/library/pure/highcharts/highcharts/tree/master/samples/highcharts/plotoptions/series-point-events-click/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Demo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://api.highcharts.com/highcharts/plotOptions.series.point.events.click\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">API option</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"5-범례-항목-클릭-이벤트-legend-item-click-event\" style=\"position:relative;\">5. 범례 항목 클릭 이벤트 (Legend Item Click Event)<a href=\"#5-%EB%B2%94%EB%A1%80-%ED%95%AD%EB%AA%A9-%ED%81%B4%EB%A6%AD-%EC%9D%B4%EB%B2%A4%ED%8A%B8-legend-item-click-event\" aria-label=\"5 범례 항목 클릭 이벤트 legend item click event permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h4>\n<p>범례의 <code class=\"language-text\">itemClick</code> 이벤트는 사용자가 범례 항목을 클릭할 때 발생하며, 일반적으로 시리즈의 표시 여부를 토글합니다. <code class=\"language-text\">false</code>를 반환하거나 <code class=\"language-text\">event.preventDefault()</code>를 호출하여 이 기본 동작을 막고 대신 커스텀 동작을 구현할 수 있습니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-js line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-js\">Highcharts<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">chart</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'container'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token literal-property property\">legend</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token literal-property property\">events</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n      <span class=\"token function-variable function\">itemClick</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">e</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> visibility <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> e<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>legendItem<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>visible <span class=\"token operator\">?</span> <span class=\"token string\">'visible'</span> <span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">'hidden'</span>\r\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\r\n          <span class=\"token operator\">!</span><span class=\"token function\">confirm</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\r\n            <span class=\"token string\">'The series is currently '</span> <span class=\"token operator\">+</span>\r\n              visibility <span class=\"token operator\">+</span>\r\n              <span class=\"token string\">'. Do you want to change '</span> <span class=\"token operator\">+</span>\r\n              <span class=\"token string\">'that?'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n          <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n          <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">false</span>\r\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n      <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token literal-property property\">series</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n      <span class=\"token literal-property property\">data</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">2</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">3</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">4</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://jsfiddle.net/gh/get/library/pure/highcharts/highcharts/tree/master/samples/highcharts/legend/pie-legend-itemclick/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Demo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://api.highcharts.com/highcharts/legend.events.itemClick\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">API option</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"이벤트-핸들러-인자-event-handler-arguments\" style=\"position:relative;\">이벤트 핸들러 인자 (Event Handler Arguments)<a href=\"#%EC%9D%B4%EB%B2%A4%ED%8A%B8-%ED%95%B8%EB%93%A4%EB%9F%AC-%EC%9D%B8%EC%9E%90-event-handler-arguments\" aria-label=\"이벤트 핸들러 인자 event handler arguments permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>각 핸들러는 인터랙션에 대한 세부 정보가 담긴 이벤트 객체를 받습니다. 공통 속성으로는 커서 좌표(<code class=\"language-text\">chartX</code>, <code class=\"language-text\">chartY</code>), 축 범위, 대상 요소 등이 있습니다. <code class=\"language-text\">this</code> 컨텍스트는 이벤트를 발생시킨 요소(<code class=\"language-text\">chart</code>, <code class=\"language-text\">series</code> 또는 <code class=\"language-text\">point</code>)를 가리킵니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-js line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-js\">Highcharts<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">chart</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"container\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token literal-property property\">chart</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token literal-property property\">events</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n      <span class=\"token function-variable function\">click</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">event</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n        console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"Mouse X:\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> event<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>chartX<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Mouse Y:\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> event<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>chartY<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n      <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token literal-property property\">series</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n      <span class=\"token literal-property property\">data</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">2</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">3</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">4</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://jsfiddle.net/gh/get/library/pure/highcharts/highcharts/tree/master/samples/highcharts/chart/events-click/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Demo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://api.highcharts.com/highcharts/chart.events.click\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">API</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"highcharts에서-promise-및-비동기-데이터-처리-dealing-with-promises-and-asynchronous-data-in-highcharts\" style=\"position:relative;\">Highcharts에서 Promise 및 비동기 데이터 처리 (Dealing with Promises and Asynchronous Data in Highcharts)<a href=\"#highcharts%EC%97%90%EC%84%9C-promise-%EB%B0%8F-%EB%B9%84%EB%8F%99%EA%B8%B0-%EB%8D%B0%EC%9D%B4%ED%84%B0-%EC%B2%98%EB%A6%AC-dealing-with-promises-and-asynchronous-data-in-highcharts\" aria-label=\"highcharts에서 promise 및 비동기 데이터 처리 dealing with promises and asynchronous data in highcharts permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>Highcharts는 <code class=\"language-text\">Highcharts.chart()</code>가 실행될 때 데이터가 준비되어 있기를 기대합니다. 그러나 데이터를 비동기적으로 로드하는 것은 매우 일반적입니다. 이러한 경우 차트는 보통 <strong>빈 데이터나 플레이스홀더(placeholder) 데이터</strong>로 초기화된 후, 실제 데이터가 가져와지면 업데이트됩니다.</p>\n<p>주요 접근 방식은 두 가지입니다.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>차트를 생성하기 전에 데이터를 먼저 가져온 후 <code class=\"language-text\">Highcharts.chart()</code>에 직접 전달하거나,</li>\n<li>차트를 먼저 생성하고 데이터가 준비되면 업데이트하는 방식으로, 실시간 또는 지속적으로 업데이트되는 데이터에 유용합니다.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>일반적인 패턴은 <code class=\"language-text\">fetch()</code>(또는 다른 비동기 API)를 사용하여 데이터를 로드한 후 <code class=\"language-text\">series.setData()</code> 또는 <code class=\"language-text\">series.addPoint()</code>를 사용하여 차트를 업데이트하는 것입니다. 이 메서드들은 자동으로 다시 그리기(redraw)를 트리거합니다. 성능상의 이유로 여러 업데이트를 한꺼번에 처리해야 하는 경우, 모든 업데이트를 적용한 후 <code class=\"language-text\">chart.redraw()</code>를 수동으로 호출할 수 있습니다.</p>\n<p>비동기 로딩은 대용량 데이터셋이나 맵 시각화에서 특히 유용하며, 데이터 요청을 지연함으로써 성능을 개선하고 UI의 반응성을 유지합니다.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 768px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/a921a36d0287f18bf3fc3c2a22970368/08990/image01.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 79.16666666666667%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/a921a36d0287f18bf3fc3c2a22970368/a59e9/image01.webp 192w,\n/static/a921a36d0287f18bf3fc3c2a22970368/0ca9f/image01.webp 384w,\n/static/a921a36d0287f18bf3fc3c2a22970368/dc9b9/image01.webp 768w,\n/static/a921a36d0287f18bf3fc3c2a22970368/e6b23/image01.webp 1010w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/a921a36d0287f18bf3fc3c2a22970368/3b721/image01.png 192w,\n/static/a921a36d0287f18bf3fc3c2a22970368/66595/image01.png 384w,\n/static/a921a36d0287f18bf3fc3c2a22970368/fe486/image01.png 768w,\n/static/a921a36d0287f18bf3fc3c2a22970368/08990/image01.png 1010w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/a921a36d0287f18bf3fc3c2a22970368/fe486/image01.png\"\n            alt=\"alt text\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://jsfiddle.net/api/post/library/pure/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Live random data</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.highcharts.com/docs/working-with-data/live-data\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Live data 문서</a> 를 참고하세요.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h5>참고</h5>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.highcharts.com/docs/chart-concepts/common-events\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Understanding Common Highcharts Events | Highcharts</a></li>\n</ul>","tableOfContents":"<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#understanding-common-highcharts-events-highcharts-%EC%A3%BC%EC%9A%94-%EC%9D%B4%EB%B2%A4%ED%8A%B8-%EC%9D%B4%ED%95%B4%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0\">Understanding Common Highcharts Events (Highcharts 주요 이벤트 이해하기)</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#highcharts%EC%97%90%EC%84%9C-%EC%9D%B4%EB%B2%A4%ED%8A%B8%EB%A5%BC-%EC%97%B0%EA%B2%B0%ED%95%98%EB%8A%94-%EB%B0%A9%EB%B2%95-ways-to-attach-events-in-highcharts\">Highcharts에서 이벤트를 연결하는 방법 (Ways to Attach Events in Highcharts)</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#%EA%B0%81-%EB%B0%A9%EB%B2%95%EC%9D%98-%EC%84%A0%ED%83%9D-%EA%B8%B0%EC%A4%80-when-to-choose-each-method\">각 방법의 선택 기준 (When to Choose Each Method)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#%EC%BD%94%EB%93%9C-%EC%98%88%EC%8B%9C-code-examples\">코드 예시 (Code Examples)</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#%EC%A3%BC%EC%9A%94-%EC%9D%B4%EB%B2%A4%ED%8A%B8-common-events\">주요 이벤트 (Common Events)</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#1-%EC%B0%A8%ED%8A%B8-%EB%A1%9C%EB%93%9C-%EC%9D%B4%EB%B2%A4%ED%8A%B8-chart-load-event\">1. 차트 로드 이벤트 (Chart Load Event)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#2-%EC%B0%A8%ED%8A%B8-%EB%A0%8C%EB%8D%94-%EC%9D%B4%EB%B2%A4%ED%8A%B8-chart-render-event\">2. 차트 렌더 이벤트 (Chart Render Event)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#3-%EC%B0%A8%ED%8A%B8-%EC%84%A0%ED%83%9D-%EC%9D%B4%EB%B2%A4%ED%8A%B8-chart-selection-event\">3. 차트 선택 이벤트 (Chart Selection Event)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#4-%ED%8F%AC%EC%9D%B8%ED%8A%B8-%ED%81%B4%EB%A6%AD-%EC%9D%B4%EB%B2%A4%ED%8A%B8-point-click-event\">4. 포인트 클릭 이벤트 (Point Click Event)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#5-%EB%B2%94%EB%A1%80-%ED%95%AD%EB%AA%A9-%ED%81%B4%EB%A6%AD-%EC%9D%B4%EB%B2%A4%ED%8A%B8-legend-item-click-event\">5. 범례 항목 클릭 이벤트 (Legend Item Click Event)</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#%EC%9D%B4%EB%B2%A4%ED%8A%B8-%ED%95%B8%EB%93%A4%EB%9F%AC-%EC%9D%B8%EC%9E%90-event-handler-arguments\">이벤트 핸들러 인자 (Event Handler Arguments)</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#highcharts%EC%97%90%EC%84%9C-promise-%EB%B0%8F-%EB%B9%84%EB%8F%99%EA%B8%B0-%EB%8D%B0%EC%9D%B4%ED%84%B0-%EC%B2%98%EB%A6%AC-dealing-with-promises-and-asynchronous-data-in-highcharts\">Highcharts에서 Promise 및 비동기 데이터 처리 (Dealing with Promises and Asynchronous Data in Highcharts)</a></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>","fields":{"gitLastModified":"Oct 7, 2026"},"frontmatter":{"title":"주요 이벤트","summary":"Understanding Common Highcharts Events (Highcharts 주요 이벤트 이해하기) Highcharts는 차트와 그 구성 요소에 인터랙티비티(interactivity)와 커스텀 동작을 추가할 수 있는 유연한 이벤트 시스템을 제공합니다. 이 가이드는 Highcharts에서 가장 일반적이고","date":"Dec 31, 2025","categories":["Highcharts"],"tags":[""],"author":["aluvy"],"thumbnail":null}}}]}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/posts/highcharts/05_events/","prev":{"slug":"/posts/highcharts/04_other/","title":"기타 (템플릿, 반응형 차트)"},"next":null}},"staticQueryHashes":["1397594759","2043619371"],"slicesMap":{}}